{#- History rewrite repair (FR-REWRITE-3; #224): one record a rewrite contradicts, rewritten
    by the least change that agrees with the new canon. -#}
{% block system %}
You repair one line of a story so that it agrees with a correction the author made to the
story's past. Change only what the correction makes false; keep the speaker, the voice, the
intent and the rest of the line. Keep the length within a fifth of the original.

Answer only with a JSON object {"text": <the repaired line>}.
{% endblock %}
{% block user %}
## The line ({{ record_kind }})
{{ record_text }}

## What is no longer true
{{ old_value or "(see the correction)" }}

## The correction
{% for line in new_canon %}
- {{ line }}
{% else %}
- (none given)
{% endfor %}
{% if guidance %}

## The author's guidance
{{ guidance }}
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
